  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 200°/180°C fan-forced. Finely chop the brown onion. Finely chop the carrot and capsicum. Finely chop the garlic. Drain and rinse the black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6181f4c0a611b50e063c09ef/step-a7062cd2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot! Add less if you're sensitive to heat.\n• In a deep frying pan or large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook the onion, carrot and capsicum, stirring, until softened, 5-7 minutes. Add the Mexican Fiesta spice blend and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6181f4c0a611b50e063c09ef/step-8a45817c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the diced tomatoes, black beans, vegetable stock powder, brown sugar and the hot water (2 tbs for 2 people / 1/4 cup for 4 people) to the pan. Stir to combine. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to medium and simmer until slightly thickened, 10-15 minutes. Stir in the butter. Season with salt and pepper.\n• TIP: Butter helps balance the acidity of the tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6181f4c0a611b50e063c09ef/step-a9a44747.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the chilli is simmering, cut the mini flour tortillas (see ingredients) into wedges. Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle (or spray) with olive oil, then season. Arrange in a single layer and bake until golden, 6-8 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, spread the chips out over two oven trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6181f4c0a611b50e063c09ef/step-40a428f1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the tortilla chips are baking, roughly chop the coriander.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6181f4c0a611b50e063c09ef/step-b94b35c3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the Mexican bean and veggie chilli between bowls. Sprinkle with the shredded Cheddar cheese and coriander. Top with a dollop of light sour cream. Serve with the baked tortilla chips.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6181f4c0a611b50e063c09ef/step-e5236ad9.jpg"
    }
  ]
